ge":{"column":0,"endColumn":13,"endLine":161,"line":141},"type":30,"typeText":"∀ {α : Type u_1} [inst : LT.{u_1} α] [inst_1 : Std.PRange.UpwardEnumerable.{u_1} α]\n  [Std.PRange.LawfulUpwardEnumerable.{u_1} α] [inst_3 : Std.Rxo.HasSize.{u_1} α] [Std.Rxo.LawfulHasSize.{u_1} α],\n  Std.Rxo.IsAlwaysFinite.{u_1} α","unsafe":false,"value":491,"source":{"code":"instance instIsAlwaysFiniteOfLawfulHasSize [LT α] [UpwardEnumerable α]\n    [LawfulUpwardEnumerable α] [HasSize α] [LawfulHasSize α] :\n    IsAlwaysFinite α where\n  finite lo hi := by\n    refine ⟨HasSize.size lo hi, ?_⟩\n    generalize hn : HasSize.size lo hi = n\n    induction n generalizing lo with\n    | zero =>\n      simp only [size_eq_zero_iff_not_le] at hn\n      simp [succMany?_zero, hn]\n    | succ =>\n      rename_i n ih\n      rw [succMany?_add_one_eq_succ?_bind_succMany?]\n      match hs : succ? lo with\n      | none => simp\n      | some a =>\n        simp only [Option.bind_some]\n        apply ih\n        have : lo < hi := size_pos_iff_lt.mp (by omega)\n        rw [LawfulHasSize.size_eq_succ_of_succ?_eq_some (h := this) (h' := hs)] at hn\n        omega","start":141,"end":161},"axioms":["Classical.choice","Quot.sound","propext"]}